# F1 (QUALIFICATION): the Lever N final-hold FAULT on the gate profile c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-ship-full-final-hold-gate (the audit twin plus the final-hold fault injection; THE INTEGRATION MUST ADD THIS
# PROFILE if it is absent, as tp4/lever-n carries it in best-levern-final-hold-time-gate). Adapted from tp4-lever-n-jobs F1. READ: levern_decoder_finishes: a
# decoder in flight when the held final chunk faults still finishes its answer; the faulted prefill fails ITS request only (a clean error for that user), the
# other seats' streams are unaffected, the engine stays up, no hang; levern_equal_busy: output equals the run without the fault. Real time ~20.
# TEMPLATE of .github/c2-serving-job.env for the ship/262k-full pack (scripts/ci/c2_serving_job.py parses it): copy it over that file on a throwaway
# commit of ship/262k-full (with its evidence files committed) and push a tag experiment/c2-serving-vN. Names no rig, card, host or registry. ORDER.txt has
# the order, stop rules, real minutes, NEEDS and the GO rule. C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-serve-10 is the ONE shipping image X0B builds: every job serves it.
C2_CARDS=quad
C2_ACTIONS=reset smoke
C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-serve-10
C2_PROFILE=c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-ship-full-final-hold-gate
C2_SMOKE_TESTS=warmup,levern_decoder_finishes,levern_equal_busy
